=== reject/lists/bracket-word-is-an-unclosed-list.nu
shape shape_internalcall 0..4 "echo"
shape shape_list 5..6 "["
shape shape_string 6..9 "x]y"
error nu::parser::unclosed_delimiter: Unclosed delimiter.
  label 5..6 "[": unclosed — opens here (need `]`)
  label 9..9 "": expected `]` here
  help: Add a matching `]` to close this delimiter, or check that an earlier closer closed the wrong block.
=== reject/lists/pipe-pipe-between-items.nu
shape shape_list 0..1 "["
shape shape_int 1..2 "1"
shape shape_list 2..3 " "
shape shape_string 3..5 "||"
shape shape_list 5..6 " "
shape shape_int 6..7 "2"
shape shape_list 7..8 "]"
error nu::parser::shell_oror: The '||' operator is not supported in Nushell
  label 3..5 "||": instead of '||', use 'try' or 'or'
  help: use 'try' instead of the shell '||', or 'or' instead of the boolean '||'
=== reject/lists/semicolon-between-items.nu
shape shape_list 0..1 "["
shape shape_string 1..2 "a"
shape shape_list 2..5 " | "
shape shape_string 5..6 "b"
shape shape_list 6..11 " ; c]"
error : Unexpected semicolon in list
  label 7..8 ";": not a valid list separator
  help: Use commas or whitespace to separate list items.
=== reject/lists/semicolon-single.nu
shape shape_list 0..1 "["
shape shape_int 1..2 "1"
shape shape_list 2..6 "; 2]"
error : Unexpected semicolon in list
  label 2..3 ";": not a valid list separator
  help: Use commas or whitespace to separate list items.
=== reject/lists/trailing-pipe.nu
shape shape_list 0..1 "["
shape shape_int 1..2 "1"
shape shape_list 2..3 " "
shape shape_int 3..4 "2"
shape shape_list 4..7 " |]"
error nu::parser::unexpected_eof: Unexpected end of code.
  label 5..6 "|": expected closing pipeline missing end
